    "publish_date": "2025-12-31",
    "summary_en": "Lianhe Photonics (300691) disclosed on 2025-12-31 that controlling shareholder and actual controller Gong Junqiang pledged 500,000 shares, or 1.05% of his holdings and 0.19% of total share capital, with a pledge period from 2025-12-30 to 2035-03-25 to Industrial Bank Zhongshan Branch for working capital. After this pledge, Gong Junqiang's cumulative pledged shares total 25,690,000, equal to 53.80% of his 47,747,349 shares and 9.55% of total share capital. Combined with co-acting shareholder Qiu Shengping's 3,500,000 pledged shares, the controlling group's cumulative pledged shares total 29,190,000, or 45.40% of the group's holdings and 10.85% of total share capital. The company states that the pledges are within controllable risk, with no mention of margin call or forced-transfer risk in the filing beyond that statement.",
